  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Trim green beans, then cut into thirds.\n• Half-fill a large saucepan with water, add a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil over high heat. Cook orecchiette in the boiling water until 'al dente', 8 minutes. TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d27044d1132925101cff6-07a63b27.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When pasta has 5 minutes remaining, place a colander (or steamer basket) on top of the saucepan. Add green beans to colander, then cover with a lid and steam until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people). Add baby spinach leaves to colander. Drain pasta over veggies. Set aside. TIP: Draining the pasta over the veggies is an easy way to wilt the spinach!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d27044d1132925101cff6-561a05d3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan over medium-low heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic paste until fragrant, 1 minute. Add light cooking cream, Dijon mustard, vegetable stock pot and reserved pasta water. Cook, stirring, until slightly reduced, 2 minutes.\n• Add Cheddar cheese and Parmesan cheese, stirring, until combined, 30 seconds. Remove from heat. Stir veggies and pasta through the sauce, until combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d27044d1132925101cff6-62dc7ec2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir a drizzle of truffle oil (if using) through pasta.\n• Divide truffle 'mac' and cheese between bowls.\n• Garnish with a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) to serve. Enjoy! TIP: Truffle oil has a strong flavour, so add less or leave it out if desired!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d27044d1132925101cff6-c8594911.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
